43130/extras/47f39cafe2920a70cc59a3d63b715325.mp4?t=1771037686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Ophelia Vanderlyn</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ophelia returns to the town searching for answers she cannot fully explain. As she explores its distorted streets and abandoned interiors, fragmented memories and unsettling encounters begin to surface. The town reflects her unstable perception of reality, forcing her to confront suppressed thoughts and a past she refuses to face. What begins as a search slowly turns into a deeply personal descent, where the line between reality and delusion grows increasingly unclear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243130/extras/8a9dd3c5dfd4bdd25492bfb4130f9fb7.poster.avif?t=1771037686\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243130/extras/8a9dd3c5dfd4bdd25492bfb4130f9fb7.webm?t=1771037686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243130/extras/8a9dd3c5dfd4bdd25492bfb4130f9fb7.mp4?t=1771037686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a third-person psychological horror game that combines exploration, <strong>weapon-based combat</strong>, and puzzle-solving. Progress through interconnected environments by solving environmental, coded, and logic-based puzzles while <strong>using firearms to defend yourself against hostile threats</strong>. The game focuses on atmosphere, tension, and narrative-driven discovery as the world subtly shifts around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted